１単元の株式数は100株であります。
完全議決権株式であり、権利内容に何ら限定のない、当社の標準となる株式であります。
</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_ClassASharesMember">A種種類株式</jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered contextRef="FilingDateInstant_ClassASharesMember">非上場</jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_ClassASharesMember">
